@startuml
title Diagrama de Secuencia - Crear Docente

actor "Administrador" as Actor
participant "Frontend (React)" as FE
participant "DocenteController" as Controller
participant "UsuarioService" as Service
participant "UsuarioRepository" as Repo

Actor -> FE: Rellena formulario y pulsa "Guardar"
activate FE

FE -> Controller: POST /api/docentes\n(Header: Authorization: Bearer <token>, Body: DocenteDTO)
activate Controller

Controller -> Service: crearDocente(DocenteDTO)
activate Service

Service -> Repo: findByDni(dni)
activate Repo
Repo --> Service: Optional.empty()
deactivate Repo

Service -> Repo: save(nuevoDocente)
activate Repo
Repo --> Service: Usuario (persisted)
deactivate Repo

Service --> Controller: DocenteDTO (con ID)
deactivate Service

Controller --> FE: 201 Created (JSON: DocenteDTO)
deactivate Controller

FE -> FE: Mostrar notificación de éxito
FE -> FE: Redirigir a listado (/dashboard/docentes)
FE --> Actor: Muestra listado actualizado
deactivate FE

@enduml
